cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Edge service platform: SDN-controlled containerised edge services with metadata-driven scaling"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction artefact for a Master's thesis on efficient storage and resource
  management at the network edge. Contains the SDN controller, the Dockerised edge
  and storage servers, the topology and workload tooling, and the configuration of
  the experiment campaigns. Campaign outputs are not included.
authors:
